    "turn_idx": 58,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's not accurate, A, and B, I think he's politicizing something in a way that's unhelpful. Now, if he wants to contrast his policy proposals with your policy proposals, he says, you say, well, we ought to do this, and he says we ought to do that, and we have that debate. Well, that's fine. That's what it's supposed to be about. I think it needs to be We need to stop doing this thing where it's like, I care more about the issue than you do. Because I just don't think that's true and I don't think that's fair. I think we all, we all care about it and we all trying to do something about it. It's just there's many paths to a solution here and we gotta try to find the best one.",
