    "turn_idx": 81,
    "turn_text": "Well, our military are soldiers, and that's the thing that we're trying to fight is a lot of the bad cops think of themselves as soldiers or as warriors, and they think of themselves as going to war, and if that's the mentality, who's the enemy? If our cops patrolling our civilian neighborhoods are at war, then the enemy apparently is us. And that's the mentality I want out. And we're not going to solve that by sending in literal soldiers.",
